Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: Lumo base system miscellaneous files
 This package contains the basic filesystem hierarchy of a Kernora system, and
 several important miscellaneous files, such as /etc/debian_version,
 /etc/host.conf, /etc/issue, /etc/motd, /etc/profile, and others,
 and the text of several common licenses. Kernora OS is derived from Debian.
